tlite plan

1. Profile
   Entry encoding, leaf, erasure and bundle format written down.
   done when: profile v0.1 tagged; test vectors generated by a script.

2. Core
   Merkle log in SQLite tables, proofs, signed checkpoints.
   done when: v0.1.0 on crates.io; vectors pass; fuzzing runs in CI.

3. Extension
   Loadable SQLite extension and plain-SQL trigger mode.
   done when: v0.2.0 binaries; loaded from Python, Go and the sqlite3
   shell in CI; rollback adds no leaf.

4. Verifier
   Library, CLI and WebAssembly page.
   done when: v0.3.0; checkpoints and proofs cross-checked with an
   independent Go implementation in both directions.

5. Time-stamps
   RFC 3161 tokens and witness cosignatures.
   done when: v0.4.0; real tokens from two TSAs verified offline in CI.

6. Release
   Documentation, security review, packaging.
   done when: v1.0.0 signed; review findings closed.
